r left / middle clicks / long press etc?"],["b8ad29e2_669cda7b",41,-2,1,"This is a little hard to follow. Could we refactor this based on which type of button clicked? something like ```ts if (e.button === BUTTON_LEFT) { if (this.isLoading_) { ... } else { ... } ... }…"]],0,504],[7116260,20419,192,3.856,3.092,[[23,0.6,3,120],[29,0.133,1,25],[47,0.081,0,15],[48,0.057,21,11],[49,0.029,0,5],[50,0.024,0,4],[6,0.024,116,4],[1,0.024,65,4],[40,0.019,2,3],[51,0.01,0,1]],[["3d16270e_c6b133ff",47,-8,1,"hmm... I may not fully understand the diff of these two. Could you elaborate more about what is different from the above?"],["248d53ef_70c49866",48,-7,1,"Nit: I think here is the only place you do not check `changes[1].cookie.Name()`"],["8e98c154_0d404451",47,-6,1,"what is the definition of \"other attribute\" here? Do you have a reference to the list of keys considered they are attributes?"],["77b510b9_43bcef13",47,-2,1,"nit: `))` to close the paren just before `However`."],["88cbc479_ae1327bc",49,0,1,"Please add unit test coverage for these two cases."]],0,505],[7244755,20432,10,0.421,0.3,[[17,35]],[],0,506],[7174425,20438,140,4.21,3.407,[[10,39]],[["5d3994f2_51ffa521",36,-5,1,"nit: Could we keep the period here?"],["e9f75a33_6155daa8",50,-5,1,"At the moment we're trying to avoid adding feature code to `Browser` / `BrowserView` directly. Wdyt if we introduce a new `BrowserWindowFeature`, adding it to the other features in…"],["0dcf1ebc_396c38d6",51,-2,1,"Given this class specifically needs the `ui::BaseWindow` we should probably pass only the `ui::BaseWindow` dependency. To do so we should move init of this feature under…"],["be06bda4_911bc939",52,-2,1,"Based on browser design principles it's probably best to host this file and its impl under `chrome/browser/ui/waap/` (`//c/b/ui/browser_window/public` is typically reserved for classes / APIs…"],["c2d23485_fa0e23ec",52,-2,1,"nit: I think this can be `bool ShouldDeferShow() const`"],["e04e9f9f_eacf1ea2",53,-2,1,"The new approac